 "title": "TMPW 5: 5 W encapsulated AC/DC module, 90-305 VAC in, 4000 VAC isolation",
 "source": {
  "document": "TMPW 5 Series, 5 Watt",
  "revision": "Rev. April 16, 2026",
  "pages": 5
 },
 "summary": "A potted, through-hole AC/DC converter that delivers 5 W at one of four fixed output voltages (3.3, 5, 12 or 24 V) from mains between 90 and 305 VAC, or from 100 to 430 VDC of either polarity. Input and output are separated by reinforced insulation tested at 4000 VAC for 60 s. The EMI filter is inside the module, idle input power stays at or below 100 mW, and the case measures 37.0 × 27.5 × 17.5 mm. It runs from -40 °C to +70 °C, with power derated above 50 °C and below -30 °C. The 12 V model, TMPW 5-112, gives 420 mA at 81 % typical efficiency.",
